+# Architecture interface
+
+Use when the solution changes system, container, component ownership, deployment
+topology or a cross-boundary contract. State the affected boundary and the intended
+responsibility distribution. Show only the relevant C4 level or supporting view:
+system context, containers, deployment, dynamic flow or another justified diagram.
+
+Describe relationships, communication purpose, data/control crossings, technology
+constraints and confirmed architectural decisions. Reference existing HLD/LLD/NFR
+documents and describe the solution delta rather than copying them. Include a flow
+when ordering, ownership, failure or recovery affects the decision.
+
+Do not invent containers for folders, teams or tools. Do not put implementation
+classes or unconfirmed target requirements in this artifact. Record affected
+architecture documents and verification obligations for the publish phase.
